    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... Gahh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those sick bastards! I can't believe they, they...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Those beasts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were they Reunion's doing...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion enslaved infected beasts to use as troops...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's not that simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can feel it, they...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are no mere beasts. In fact, they're more like us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Instructor Dobermann...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss... What should we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Give them a merciful end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
